  "markdown": "Where we work\n\n# Wallpaper installation in Belgravia\n\nStucco townhouses, mansion flats and hotels in Belgravia and Knightsbridge, SW1. We survey, supply where asked, hang, and return once the paper has settled.\n\n[Start your project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/) [See the work](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/)\n\nBelgravia houses often have tall rooms, deep cornices and original joinery. That means long drops, careful set-out from a fixed point, and protection of the plasterwork and woodwork that is already there.\n\nPrivate clients are not named. Residential work appears only by street or area, with the homeowner's agreement. If you would like to see comparable rooms, ask, and we will arrange what discretion allows.\n\n![Finished white columned entrance and black railings on St George's Square, Pimlico, with the scaffold down.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/pimlico-st-georges-square-exterior-11-800.webp)\n\nBelgravia homes appear in the [fuller project record](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/#project-record), by area only. Shown here: the finished stucco entrance at [St George's Square, Pimlico](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/pimlico-st-georges-square/), nearby in SW1. Photograph: Mr Wallcover.\n\nQuestions\n\n## Questions about papering in Belgravia\n\nIllustrative material studies\n\nPause motion\n\n### Can you hang wallpaper in a listed Belgravia townhouse?\n\nYes. We follow the specification and whatever the consents for the building allow. If a wall is not ready for the material, we say so at the survey, before the paper is ordered.\n\n### Do you work with interior designers in Belgravia?\n\nYes. The designer or the client usually supplies the paper (free-issue). We manage delivery, check the quantities against our measure, and hang to the designer's specification.\n\n## What happens next\n\n1. Dorin Burcus reads your note.\n2. You can book a 20-minute call to talk the project through.\n3. If the project needs a survey, we arrange it after we have spoken.\n4. After the survey we write a scope of works by room.\n\n[Start your project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
